#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.md:3
msgid "AMDGPU Asynchronous Operations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.md:6
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.md:8
msgid ""
"Asynchronous operations are operations whose completion is not tracked "
"internally by the compiler. A thread that initiates one or more async "
"operations can use *asyncmarks* to track their completion."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.md:12
msgid "Most {ref}`DMA operations <amdgpu-dma-operations>` are asynchronous."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.md:14
msgid "Asyncmarks"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.md:16
msgid ""
"An *asyncmark* created by a thread can be used to track async operations "
"initiated by that thread."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.md:19
msgid "Stages"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.md:21
msgid ""
"A *stage* names a kind of async operation. Each async operation *belongs to* "
"the one stage determined by the instruction that initiates it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.md:24
msgid "The stages are:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.md:0
msgid "Bit"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.md:0
msgid "Stage"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.md:0
msgid "Async operations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.md:0
msgid "0"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.md:0
msgid "`TENSOR`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.md:0
msgid "tensor loads and stores"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.md:0
msgid "1"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.md:0
msgid "`GLOBAL_LOAD_ASYNC_TO_LDS`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.md:0
msgid "global loads async to LDS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.md:0
msgid "2"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.md:0
msgid "`GLOBAL_LOAD_ASYNC_TO_LDS_MCAST`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.md:0
msgid "multicast (cluster) global loads async to LDS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.md:0
msgid "3"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.md:0
msgid "`GLOBAL_STORE_ASYNC_FROM_LDS`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.md:0
msgid "async global stores from LDS"
msgstr ""

