msgid ""
"Two kinds of async operation are in flight at once. Each is marked with a "
"mask naming only its own stage, so each can be waited for without waiting "
"for the other."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.md:241
msgid ""
"Had both marks used the zero mask, the first wait would have drained the "
"tensor load as well, and the overlap would have been lost."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.md:244
msgid ""
"The same applies to two stages tracked by one hardware counter. Here both "
"stages use the async counter, but the sequences are still separate:"
msgstr ""

